-page_title "Your API Key"
-breadcrumb :api_key
-# This page shows the key: send no referrer (see `ApiKeysController#no_referrer`).
-content_for :meta_tags do
  %meta{content: "no-referrer", name: "referrer"}

.callout-blue.mb-4
  %p Your API key:
  %p
    %code#api-key=@key
  %p
    %strong Copy it now. It is shown only this once:
    we store only a fingerprint of it, so we cannot show it again. If you lose it, please register again.

%h6 How to use it
%p
  Send the key in the
  %code=ApiAccess::HEADER
  header, never in the web address. For example:
%pre.pre-wrapped="curl -H \"#{ApiAccess::HEADER}: #{@key}\" https://www.antcat.org/v1/taxa"

%p="Your limits: #{ApiAccess.describe(@api_key.limits)}."
%p
  Please cite AntCat in your work:
  =ApiAccess::CITATION

%p
  Working on a larger project? Brian Fisher welcomes collaborations; write to
  =mail_to ApiAccess::CONTACT
